k claim/renew/poll/release, a 120-second holder lifetime, anchored 60-second cadence, server-issued generations, draining reservations, late-reply rejection, scoped cached responses and terminal shutdown. Proposed deterministic tests cover those transitions.","evidenceReferences":["docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S001/LLD.md:2.2 ProgressSnapshot","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S001/LLD.md:2.3 ObservationReply","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S001/LLD.md:7. Test strategy",".insrc/tmp/design-review/consolidated-chat-progress-s1-lld.json:attempt 2 completedChunks/observation"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["observation"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"validation","findingId":"validation-01"},"rationale":"Accepted fresh validation inspection has no limitations. The strategy now explicitly covers observer-independent owner renewal and expiry, separate task associations, removal and stale callbacks, active/inactive/global capacity saturation, full observer queues, terminal delivery and continuing execution. The current normalization-test defect validation-03 is a distinct concern.","evidenceReferences":["docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S001/LLD.md:7. Test strategy",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-206db3426ffd4428-s1.json:/body/testStrategy/testLevels",".insrc/tmp/design-review/consolidated-chat-progress-s1-lld.json:attempt 2 completedChunks/validation"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["validation"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"validation","findingId":"validation-02"},"rationale":"Accepted fresh validation inspection checked all three local predecessor story records without limitations. The current crosswalk maps S001/#42 to s1–s2, S002/#43 to s6 and S003/#44 to s5, cites their individual LLDs, updates the contract-test fixtures and explicitly preserves tracker retirement as a separate decision.","evidenceReference