ce delivers a terminal outcome before revalidating a surviving attempt, without marking separate scenarios.","Clarify that citation c11 demonstrates temporary-session persistence exclusion rather than crash-safe progress persistence; the planned injected storage-failure fixtures must establish the latter independently."]},{"chunkId":"observation","status":"passed","summary":"All assigned selectors were inspected. The revised observer and fallback protocols address observation-01 through connection-bound attachment, permission checks, explicit lease operations, bounded expiry, cadence preservation and generation fencing. Cancellation, independent owner activity and bounded recovery align with upstream requirements and preserve downstream adapter responsibilities. No additional defect was demonstrated. Initial grant authorization remains subject to the bootstrap defect already recorded as contracts-03 in the contracts chunk.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/body/hldContextSlice/ownedContracts/1","/body/hldContextSlice/ownedContracts/2","/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/errorPaths","/citations/2","/citations/5","/citations/8","/citations/11","/citations/12","document:line:261","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-206db3426ffd4428-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/consolidated-chat-progress-s1-lld.json","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/DEF.md:constraints k2–k7; s1 and s5 acceptance criteria","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md:architecture shape, sc2, sc3, story boundaries and non-functional targets","docs/standalone/show-background-task-progress-chat-E2026110407024f1d/SPEC.md:observation, cancellation, independent retention and fallback requirements